# Rogue Mode, act 1 end to end: a new run, seven battles (auto-battle), a reward after each, the boss, act 2's camp.
# Run with --only-mod=Rogue and ROGUE_SEED=1234, the run's save (%LOCALAPPDATA%\OpenFF\rogue\run.json) removed first.
wait 13
press Z
wait 3
press Up
wait 0.5
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue$ 60
wait 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-party 20
wait 1
shots 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-camp 20
wait 1.5
shots 1
press Z
until rogue: battle 30
wait 6
press F
until rogue: (spoils|the \w+ is lost) 300
wait 1
shots 1
repeat Z 1.5 until rogue: screen rogue-(reward|summary) 90
wait 1.5
shots 1
press Z
until rogue: screen rogue-(camp|summary) 30
wait 1.5
shots 1
